WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:40.164 --> 00:00:42.499
Get outta my way!


00:00:42.533 --> 00:00:43.567
I called dibs!


00:00:45.502 --> 00:00:48.405
- Are those what I think they are?
- Wow!


00:00:48.439 --> 00:00:51.809
Oh, boy, I had to be late on cookie day!


00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:53.410
Cookie? Cookie? Cookie?


00:00:54.378 --> 00:00:56.313
- Here they come!
- Ah, it's crumb time!


00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:57.882
- I want a piece!
- Cookies! Cookies!


00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:00.551
They're at it already!


00:01:00.584 --> 00:01:02.518
- Out of my way! I want it!
- Hey, can I squeeze in, guys?


00:01:02.519 --> 00:01:05.089
- I've got beaks to feed!
- Snooze, you lose, Robert!


00:01:05.122 --> 00:01:06.824
- Oh...
- I want that cookie!


00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:08.259
- Hey!
- I called it!


00:01:08.292 --> 00:01:09.293
Snooze, you lose!


00:01:10.928 --> 00:01:13.330
- No touchbacks!
- Hey, no elbows!


00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:14.531
Oh!


00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.469
Aha!


00:01:18.502 --> 00:01:22.373
Come to papa! Ha! Score!


00:01:22.406 --> 00:01:25.142
- Wow!
- Yeah!


00:01:30.581 --> 00:01:33.851
Come on wings, don't fail me!
Don't want to miss it!


00:01:39.023 --> 00:01:40.224
My fellow storks.


00:01:40.257 --> 00:01:42.393
Now that we all have nested,


00:01:42.426 --> 00:01:45.329
we must concentrate on
the education of our offspring.


00:01:47.098 --> 00:01:48.399
Almost there!


00:01:48.432 --> 00:01:50.201
- The migration... Watch out!
- Whoa!


00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:53.137
- Incoming!
- Whoa! Oops! Oh!


00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.972
Sorry! Very late.


00:01:55.006 --> 00:01:57.942
Sparrows!


00:02:00.044 --> 00:02:02.513
Made it! Come on, cookie, let's do this.


00:02:02.546 --> 00:02:04.949
Did I miss it? Did I miss it?


00:02:04.982 --> 00:02:08.019
Don't worry, hon, you're just in time.


00:02:08.052 --> 00:02:09.420
Aw, and you brought a treat.


00:02:09.453 --> 00:02:11.522
To celebrate our new arrival!


00:02:16.093 --> 00:02:18.195
Richard, your Dad's here!


00:02:18.229 --> 00:02:22.066
Ha ha, he looks just like
I did at that age.


00:02:22.099 --> 00:02:24.668
Yeah, that's my boy.


00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:27.438
He definitely has your impatience.


00:02:27.471 --> 00:02:31.408
Looks like he's got
your pecking skills too!


00:02:31.442 --> 00:02:33.677
Come on. You can do it!


00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.913
Push, Richard. Push!


00:02:38.582 --> 00:02:40.617
Robert!


00:02:40.651 --> 00:02:43.087
Oh!


00:02:45.156 --> 00:02:47.191
You chose the wrong day, buddy!


00:03:21.192 --> 00:03:22.459
Oh?


00:03:33.337 --> 00:03:35.539
Ooh...


00:03:42.513 --> 00:03:44.048
Who have we here?


00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:48.285
Richard.


00:03:48.319 --> 00:03:51.322
Well, hello, Richard. I am Aurora.


00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.962
Shh... it's all right.


00:04:00.297 --> 00:04:01.665
Here.


00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:05.036
Mmm!


00:04:05.069 --> 00:04:08.705
That's good, isn't it?


00:04:08.739 --> 00:04:10.241
Where are your parents?


00:04:13.477 --> 00:04:15.179
Oh.


00:04:15.212 --> 00:04:16.613
Mommy!


00:04:16.647 --> 00:04:19.150
- Oh, I am not your...
- Mmm...


00:04:19.183 --> 00:04:23.020
Oh... come here.


00:04:23.054 --> 00:04:26.023
Mm... What am I gonna do with you?


00:04:36.067 --> 00:04:37.668
Hold on tight, Richard.


00:04:55.152 --> 00:04:56.420
Wow!


00:05:08.532 --> 00:05:10.767
No fish? What's in here? Frogs?


00:05:10.801 --> 00:05:12.236
No, Max, this is...


00:05:17.808 --> 00:05:20.211
Claudius, my dear.


00:05:20.244 --> 00:05:24.215
One of those pesky sparrows nearly
ruined my speech at the gathering!


00:05:24.248 --> 00:05:25.682
Mmm?


00:05:25.716 --> 00:05:28.585
Pests! What's for dinner?


00:05:28.619 --> 00:05:30.320
There is something I wanted
to talk to you about...


00:05:30.321 --> 00:05:31.555
Daddy!


00:05:31.588 --> 00:05:36.127
Aaah! Get off! Aurora!


00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:39.863
- Claudius, Max, this is...
- Get it off!


00:05:39.896 --> 00:05:42.099
- Richard!
- Off! Off, off, off!


00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:44.435
What is he doing here?


00:05:49.306 --> 00:05:51.442
He's fun! Can he stay for dinner?


00:05:51.475 --> 00:05:55.479
Certainly not.
Get this feathered leech off me!


00:05:55.512 --> 00:05:58.249
Go play with him, Max.


00:05:58.282 --> 00:06:00.484
Wanna go for a ride, Richard?


00:06:00.517 --> 00:06:02.286
- Max!
- Whoo!


00:06:11.195 --> 00:06:14.131
I found him alone in his nest.


00:06:14.165 --> 00:06:18.135
Sparrows. Stork parents
would never leave a chick!


00:06:18.169 --> 00:06:20.204
They didn't have a choice, Claudius.


00:06:20.237 --> 00:06:23.307
Their nest was... was ravaged.


00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:24.508
Oh...


00:06:24.541 --> 00:06:27.578
Still, this is none of our business.


00:06:27.611 --> 00:06:28.745
Take him back.


00:06:28.779 --> 00:06:31.448
I won't, my dear. I can't.


00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:36.253
Imagine if it was our son,
all alone in the woods.


00:06:36.287 --> 00:06:39.523
Hold on, kid. Turbulence ahead!


00:06:39.556 --> 00:06:41.325
Whoa!


00:06:41.358 --> 00:06:44.428
Where'd you go?


00:06:44.461 --> 00:06:47.264
All right. The sparrow can stay.


00:06:47.298 --> 00:06:49.433
I knew you would understand...


00:06:49.466 --> 00:06:51.835
Only... till the Fall.


00:06:51.868 --> 00:06:55.439
After that, he'll have to
look after himself. Agreed?


00:06:55.472 --> 00:06:56.840
And...


00:06:56.873 --> 00:06:59.210
I don't want the other storks
to know about this.


00:06:59.243 --> 00:07:01.312
And...


00:07:01.345 --> 00:07:03.314
he doesn't call me "Daddy".


00:07:03.347 --> 00:07:05.182
- Daddy!
- Mm?


00:07:05.216 --> 00:07:07.951
Look what I taught him!


00:07:07.984 --> 00:07:11.955
Hee, hee.


00:07:11.988 --> 00:07:14.725
Whoa!


00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:30.507
Whoa! Crazy, Max!


00:07:30.541 --> 00:07:33.877
- Can't handle it, little brother?
- Oh, I can handle it!


00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.680
- Ha ha.
- Faster, Max! Faster!


00:07:38.249 --> 00:07:41.352
Oh... oh... whoa!


00:07:41.385 --> 00:07:43.354
I meant that!


00:07:43.387 --> 00:07:44.721
- Sure you did!
- Whoa!


00:07:48.425 --> 00:07:50.193
Mm-hmm. But silent, okay?


00:07:57.801 --> 00:08:01.372
- I got it!
- Well done, my boy.


00:08:01.405 --> 00:08:03.440
That doesn't look so hard...


00:08:05.809 --> 00:08:07.311
Oh...


00:08:11.482 --> 00:08:12.482
Gotcha!


00:08:15.419 --> 00:08:17.288
Eeeh! Gross! Hmm.


00:08:21.057 --> 00:08:23.394
Whoa! Richard! Flying fish!


00:08:23.427 --> 00:08:25.429
- Yeah! Yeah! Yeah...
- Incoming!


00:08:25.462 --> 00:08:27.464
Ugh! I got it!


00:08:42.446 --> 00:08:45.816
Oh... oh...


00:08:45.849 --> 00:08:47.784
Nice!


00:08:47.818 --> 00:08:50.321
Hmm?


00:08:52.489 --> 00:08:54.291
Sorry, I fell out of bed.


00:09:03.634 --> 00:09:07.471
Come on, Max, I thought you were fast!


00:09:07.504 --> 00:09:09.306
Fast? I'll show you fast!


00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:12.075
Whatever you say, big brother!
I'm waiting!


00:09:12.108 --> 00:09:15.446
- I've almost got you!
- Ha ha, that's what you think!


00:09:15.479 --> 00:09:17.514
- Watch this!
- Richard!


00:09:17.548 --> 00:09:23.520
- Catch me if you can!
- The trees... they're so small!


00:09:23.554 --> 00:09:26.089
Hey! We're not allowed to go that high!


00:09:26.122 --> 00:09:28.859
Come on. Whoa!
You worry too much!


00:09:28.892 --> 00:09:32.363
No, it's too windy! Let's turn around.


00:09:32.396 --> 00:09:34.631
Chicken! A cool breeze
never hurt anyone.


00:09:34.665 --> 00:09:39.035
- Richard!
- Ah! Me and my big mouth!


00:09:39.069 --> 00:09:40.437
Gotcha!


00:09:43.374 --> 00:09:45.476
You didn't get me.


00:09:45.509 --> 00:09:47.411
- I came to you.
- Ha ha, oh, yeah?


00:09:47.444 --> 00:09:51.515
I was nose-diving, beanpole!
Good catch, though.


00:09:55.419 --> 00:09:58.689
- Dad's calling!
- Let's go!


00:10:07.097 --> 00:10:10.133
Why can't we take Richard with us?


00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:13.003
I mean, he's no burden,
and I could carry...


00:10:13.036 --> 00:10:15.506
Oh, be reasonable, Aurora.


00:10:15.539 --> 00:10:18.509
You knew this day would come.


00:10:22.012 --> 00:10:27.518
You are a wonderful mother, and
you have done all you can for him.


00:10:27.551 --> 00:10:30.721
But he won't survive
the journey to Africa.


00:10:30.754 --> 00:10:34.024
He has to live the life of a sparrow.


00:10:35.526 --> 00:10:37.894
Here we are. What's this all about?


00:10:37.928 --> 00:10:40.564
Finally! I've summoned the flock.


00:10:40.597 --> 00:10:43.567
- Come, Max.
- Hey, what about me?


00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:47.471
- I'm coming too, right?
- Hmm. Richard...


00:10:47.504 --> 00:10:50.073
Wait here until we return, all right?


00:10:50.106 --> 00:10:54.578
- What?! Why?!
- Do as you are told.


00:10:54.611 --> 00:10:56.947
- But we go everywhere together!
- Yeah, Mom!


00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:59.916
I'll explain everything
later. I promise.


00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:02.686
This is not fair!


00:11:02.719 --> 00:11:06.056
Max! Quit your lollygagging!


00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:20.036
Ahem. My fellow storks.


00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:25.208
Today, the old oak
has dropped its first leaf.


00:11:25.241 --> 00:11:28.445
The time of the great
migration has arrived.


00:11:28.479 --> 00:11:32.949
Citizens, we must migrate
before the winter comes.


00:11:32.983 --> 00:11:36.953
We will form a flock and fly south
to the Great Lake in Africa.


00:11:36.987 --> 00:11:40.123
Wow! Africa!


00:11:40.156 --> 00:11:42.626
Our journey is long and dangerous.


00:11:42.659 --> 00:11:44.728
- Oh, no no no no...
- And we...


00:11:44.761 --> 00:11:47.531
Mm?


00:11:50.801 --> 00:11:54.170
Hehe, hi there!


00:11:54.204 --> 00:11:57.574
- Richard!
- You know this bird?


00:11:57.608 --> 00:12:01.512
Know me? She's my mom!


00:12:03.179 --> 00:12:06.750
Claudius! Maybe we should
postpone our departure


00:12:06.783 --> 00:12:09.620
until your "family matters"
are resolved?


00:12:09.653 --> 00:12:12.556
My family matters are just fine.


00:12:12.589 --> 00:12:19.496
Richard, your mother... I mean,
Aurora should have told you long ago.


00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:21.197
Told me what?


00:12:21.231 --> 00:12:25.001
You are a sparrow, Richard.


00:12:25.035 --> 00:12:28.572
You cannot migrate.


00:12:28.605 --> 00:12:31.642
You belong here,
with the other sparrows.


00:12:38.582 --> 00:12:40.551
You almost had me there, Dad!


00:12:40.584 --> 00:12:43.119
You always did have such a...
Sense of humor.


00:12:43.153 --> 00:12:48.224
Haha. Hmm. Oh?


00:12:48.258 --> 00:12:50.861
Poor little thing.


00:12:55.599 --> 00:12:57.033
Come with me.


00:12:57.067 --> 00:12:59.135
I have something to show you.


00:12:59.169 --> 00:13:01.538
Hmm. Mom?


00:13:03.206 --> 00:13:04.675
Mom! What do you mean?


00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:06.677
- Wait!
- Richard!


00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.178
You stay here, Max.


00:13:08.211 --> 00:13:10.914
- But Dad? I...
- Stay!


00:13:10.947 --> 00:13:12.148
Our meeting is over.


00:13:12.182 --> 00:13:15.652
We shall depart at the break of dawn.


00:13:33.737 --> 00:13:35.872
Where are we?


00:13:35.906 --> 00:13:40.677
I found you here,
in this sparrow's nest.


00:13:40.711 --> 00:13:45.248
Your parents were... taken...
before you hatched.


00:13:45.281 --> 00:13:46.416
No!


00:13:46.449 --> 00:13:48.885
You're my Mom. And I'm coming with you.


00:13:48.919 --> 00:13:51.254
Richard, you can't go to Africa.


00:13:51.287 --> 00:13:53.924
I can, Mom!


00:13:53.957 --> 00:13:56.760
- It's Dad, isn't it?
- Richard, listen, we...


00:13:56.793 --> 00:13:59.796
Maybe my legs are short,
and my beak is tiny.


00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.132
But that's because I'm a small stork!


00:14:02.165 --> 00:14:04.701
But I'm gonna grow up to be a big stork!


00:14:04.735 --> 00:14:06.970
Big and strong! He'll see!


00:14:07.003 --> 00:14:09.139
- Wait!
- You'll all see!


00:14:12.643 --> 00:14:15.612
I can feel it, I can make it to Africa!


00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:16.513
Hmm.


00:14:16.547 --> 00:14:19.816
How hard can it be? It's not like
crossing an ocean or anything.


00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.818
Hurry up, you lame ducks!


00:14:21.852 --> 00:14:23.754
The Great Lake awaits!


00:14:23.787 --> 00:14:26.322
I'll show 'em how it's done!


00:14:26.356 --> 00:14:28.291
Speedy stork, coming through!


00:14:30.794 --> 00:14:31.761
Look at that little fella!


00:14:31.762 --> 00:14:34.397
With his speed, we'd be
in Africa in no time.


00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.833
My thoughts exactly!


00:14:36.867 --> 00:14:41.337
Ha ha! I'll just swing by to pick up
the family, then next stop, Africa!


00:14:41.371 --> 00:14:43.674
Argh!


00:14:43.707 --> 00:14:47.077
- Give him a chance, Dad!
- Do not provoke me, son.


00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.846
Storks could never survive the winter


00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:52.783
and sparrows could never
survive the migration.


00:14:52.816 --> 00:14:55.185
Never! That's just fact.


00:14:55.218 --> 00:14:57.353
But he can fly way better than I can!


00:14:57.387 --> 00:14:59.823
Did I not make myself clear?


00:14:59.856 --> 00:15:03.660
Sparrows are not made for
high altitudes. You know this!


00:15:03.694 --> 00:15:06.730
Richard would never
make it there alive, son.


00:15:06.763 --> 00:15:08.264
Is that what you want?


00:15:08.298 --> 00:15:12.335
I... I... Hm.


00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:17.808
- Hey, everybody! I'm home!
- Richard!


00:15:17.841 --> 00:15:20.711
- Are you all right?
- All right?


00:15:20.744 --> 00:15:23.847
Never been better!
I could fly around the world!


00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:26.449
Enough of this! Time to nest.


00:15:26.482 --> 00:15:28.151
We have a long first leg ahead of us.


00:15:28.184 --> 00:15:31.387
I can't wait!


00:15:31.421 --> 00:15:33.690
Whooo.


00:15:33.724 --> 00:15:35.225
I knew this would happen.


00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:42.899
Hey, why are you so gloomy?
We're going to Africa!


00:15:42.933 --> 00:15:45.135
Um, I guess I'm just tired.


00:15:45.168 --> 00:15:50.240
- We better crash.
- Good call.


00:15:50.273 --> 00:15:52.843
Gotta be prepped for takeoff!


00:15:52.876 --> 00:15:55.178
Am I right, big guy?


00:15:55.211 --> 00:15:56.747
Good night, beanpole.


00:15:58.749 --> 00:16:01.184
Sleep tight, little brother.


00:16:05.388 --> 00:16:07.457
Mm?


00:16:22.906 --> 00:16:27.010
Africa... Oooh.


00:16:27.043 --> 00:16:29.913
Hm.


00:16:29.946 --> 00:16:32.749
Be safe, Richard.


00:16:38.822 --> 00:16:40.791
We're running out of time.


00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.235
I can't believe we're doing this.


00:16:52.268 --> 00:16:54.070
It's for the best, Max.


00:17:13.824 --> 00:17:16.092
Huh? Good morning!


00:17:16.126 --> 00:17:18.862
Ready, willing and able to migrate!


00:17:18.895 --> 00:17:21.131
Let's get a move on...


00:17:24.835 --> 00:17:27.403
Mom? Dad?


00:17:30.006 --> 00:17:32.308
Max?


00:17:35.111 --> 00:17:37.848
Is that...? No!


00:17:37.881 --> 00:17:41.251
Wait! You forgot me!


00:17:41.284 --> 00:17:44.187
Wait! Wait for me!


00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:49.225
No!


00:17:54.064 --> 00:17:55.298
Come on!


00:18:18.188 --> 00:18:21.024
He looks dead.


00:18:21.057 --> 00:18:22.392
Poke him.


00:18:22.425 --> 00:18:25.461
What's that?


00:18:25.495 --> 00:18:27.964
Fine. I'll poke him.


00:18:27.998 --> 00:18:31.634
Hey, if you're not going to poke,
don't tell me how to poke.


00:18:31.667 --> 00:18:34.004
I do so know how to poke!


00:18:34.037 --> 00:18:36.139
See? Whoops.


00:18:36.172 --> 00:18:40.443
Ow.


00:18:41.544 --> 00:18:43.413
- Hmm...
- Huh?


00:18:43.446 --> 00:18:46.917
- Oooo hoo.
- Ah!


00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:50.954
Mmm?


00:18:50.987 --> 00:18:54.657
Who... who are you?


00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:58.895
I'm Olga, and this is
my best friend, Oleg.


00:19:01.064 --> 00:19:03.399
We're pygmy owls!


00:19:03.433 --> 00:19:07.037
Right... Oleg...


00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:10.606
- Um, am I in Africa?
- Mm? Mm!


00:19:19.282 --> 00:19:20.683
Want a bite?


00:19:20.716 --> 00:19:26.022
- Eww.
- More for us.


00:19:26.056 --> 00:19:29.092
Hey! Why would you think this is Africa?


00:19:29.125 --> 00:19:32.963
Oh. That's where I'm migrating
to with the other storks.


00:19:32.996 --> 00:19:36.032
At least I thought I was?


00:19:36.066 --> 00:19:38.301
Yeah, I heard him, Oleg.


00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:46.442
Eh... You do realize you are not
even close to being a stork, right?


00:19:46.476 --> 00:19:49.045
Ha! Shows what you know.


00:19:49.079 --> 00:19:51.247
My dad's leader of the flock.


00:19:53.416 --> 00:19:56.019
Sounds like Daddy issues to me.


00:19:57.487 --> 00:19:59.422
Oh, yeah, Oleg?


00:19:59.455 --> 00:20:01.958
So, why isn't he
with his flock then? Hm?


00:20:01.992 --> 00:20:06.029
Dad never believed in me.
Said I'd never make it.


00:20:06.062 --> 00:20:07.998
Oh! I see!


00:20:08.031 --> 00:20:12.068
Well, when you're not wanted,
you're better off on your own.


00:20:12.102 --> 00:20:14.504
- Right, Oleg?
- Wrong!


00:20:14.537 --> 00:20:18.008
I belong with my flock!
I'll catch up with them.


00:20:18.041 --> 00:20:21.411
And when I get there, my Dad
will see that I am a stork!


00:20:23.513 --> 00:20:25.015
You're very weird.


00:20:25.048 --> 00:20:27.683
I? I am weird?


00:20:27.717 --> 00:20:29.619
O-kay.


00:20:29.652 --> 00:20:33.189
Have fun with your...
"friend" or whatever.


00:20:33.223 --> 00:20:34.991
I'll go find my family.


00:20:36.026 --> 00:20:39.462
Hold your horses!


00:20:39.495 --> 00:20:42.098
South is that way!


00:20:42.132 --> 00:20:46.002
Pfft! Thanks, but we storks
know how to navigate.


00:20:46.036 --> 00:20:49.105
Fine! Go, stork boy!


00:20:49.139 --> 00:20:53.643
Ever seen a crazy bird like that?


00:20:53.676 --> 00:20:56.112
What do you mean, we're alike?


00:20:56.146 --> 00:21:00.183
"Not a stork"? I'll show her!


00:21:00.216 --> 00:21:01.551
Okay...


00:21:01.584 --> 00:21:04.754
They went south, and south is this way!


00:21:08.358 --> 00:21:09.359
No.


00:21:10.593 --> 00:21:12.395
No, south is that way.


00:21:15.198 --> 00:21:18.068
Uh... Or maybe this?


00:21:22.405 --> 00:21:24.607
Mom? Dad?!


00:21:26.342 --> 00:21:28.044
Hi, there.


00:21:28.078 --> 00:21:31.481
Oh!


00:21:31.514 --> 00:21:34.384
This is bad. This is really bad!


00:21:34.417 --> 00:21:36.652
Out of the way!


00:21:36.686 --> 00:21:38.054
Oh!


00:21:38.088 --> 00:21:40.556
- What are those things?
- Hungry!


00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.692
Follow us if you want to live!


00:21:49.465 --> 00:21:51.401
I'm right behind you.


00:21:51.434 --> 00:21:53.103
- I'm gonna catch you.
- Wait for us!


00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:57.840
Olga! Ah!


00:21:57.873 --> 00:22:00.243
Oh!


00:22:00.276 --> 00:22:01.577
Get down!


00:22:09.785 --> 00:22:12.155
I see you!


00:22:13.123 --> 00:22:14.624
Wait! I got...


00:22:14.657 --> 00:22:17.727
Oh, no, you don't!


00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:20.163
Surprise!


00:22:22.232 --> 00:22:24.167
Whoa!


00:22:25.568 --> 00:22:28.238
That won't shake them off for long.


00:22:28.271 --> 00:22:31.274
Get up, you two! He's getting away!


00:22:33.776 --> 00:22:35.145
- What now?!
- The light!


00:22:35.178 --> 00:22:37.247
We have to get closer to the light!


00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:38.548
- Got it!
- Wait!


00:22:39.849 --> 00:22:40.816
Yow!


00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:43.453
Not that close!


00:22:43.486 --> 00:22:45.488
They went over this way!


00:22:45.521 --> 00:22:46.722
Hey, bats!


00:22:46.756 --> 00:22:48.591
What are you doing?!


00:22:49.826 --> 00:22:51.761
- Hey! Let me go!
- You miss us?


00:22:51.794 --> 00:22:54.130
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


00:22:54.164 --> 00:22:55.565
- Yeah!
- Very yummy!


00:22:55.598 --> 00:22:57.400
Stork, you crazy owl!


00:22:58.634 --> 00:23:00.836
- Aah!
- Olga!


00:23:14.217 --> 00:23:18.188
Woo-hoo!


00:23:18.221 --> 00:23:21.591
Awesome!


00:23:21.624 --> 00:23:24.427
I mean... ahem.


00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.862
It's not like I needed any help.


00:23:26.896 --> 00:23:29.432
Mm-hmm. Right...


00:23:29.465 --> 00:23:32.502
See? This is what you get
for being nice.


00:23:32.535 --> 00:23:35.338
Big Bird here can take care of himself.


00:23:35.371 --> 00:23:37.807
Let's go chase some mice!


00:23:40.543 --> 00:23:43.546
Eh?


00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:48.651
Olga! Wait! Olga?


00:23:48.684 --> 00:23:51.354
Heh. You're still here?


00:23:51.387 --> 00:23:53.656
Oh, we thought you'd be
in Africa by now.


00:23:53.689 --> 00:23:55.791
Eh, I was thinking...


00:23:55.825 --> 00:24:00.563
Since we storks aren't nocturnal, and
you can see in the dark and all that...


00:24:00.596 --> 00:24:04.534
um, maybe you could, you know, guide me?


00:24:04.567 --> 00:24:05.968
Only until dawn, of course!


00:24:06.001 --> 00:24:09.872
Hmm. Do we look like
bird-sitters to you? No way!


00:24:12.442 --> 00:24:14.210
No, Oleg!


00:24:14.244 --> 00:24:17.480
And don't give me the evil eye!
Time to go home.


00:24:20.283 --> 00:24:23.253
Man, I hate your do-goodery!


00:24:23.286 --> 00:24:25.821
Ugh! We'll play nice.


00:24:25.855 --> 00:24:27.823
- Great, Olga!
- Thank Oleg.


00:24:27.857 --> 00:24:30.726
I'm doing this for him.
Come on, stork boy!


00:24:33.296 --> 00:24:35.265
I'm Richard, by the way.


00:24:54.484 --> 00:24:56.586
He hasn't spoken since we left.


00:24:56.619 --> 00:24:59.389
Max will grow from this.


00:24:59.422 --> 00:25:01.257
We did the right thing for Richard.


00:25:01.291 --> 00:25:04.294
I hope he's all right.


00:25:04.327 --> 00:25:06.296
Don't worry.


00:25:06.329 --> 00:25:09.299
I'm sure he's found
some sparrows by now.


00:25:26.516 --> 00:25:28.518
Huh?


00:25:29.852 --> 00:25:31.987
What?


00:25:34.357 --> 00:25:36.426
Where... where are we?


00:25:36.459 --> 00:25:39.329
What's going on?


00:25:39.362 --> 00:25:41.497
Oh, stop laughing!


00:25:41.531 --> 00:25:44.800
- Hey, Olga!
- I'm not fat!


00:25:44.834 --> 00:25:48.003
Hey, Olga! Wake up!


00:25:48.037 --> 00:25:51.307
Breathe!


00:25:51.341 --> 00:25:53.409
It's okay. Oh.


00:25:55.044 --> 00:25:57.313
- Eww!
- Nice one.


00:25:57.347 --> 00:25:59.915
- What's for breakfast?
- What was that?


00:25:59.949 --> 00:26:02.017
Never seen a pellet before?


00:26:02.051 --> 00:26:04.354
It's a little of this, little of that.


00:26:04.387 --> 00:26:05.588
You don't really wanna know.


00:26:07.022 --> 00:26:09.359
What are we doing on this thing?


00:26:09.392 --> 00:26:11.461
I belong in the air!


00:26:11.494 --> 00:26:12.962
Um, excuse me?


00:26:12.995 --> 00:26:15.097
Who had to fall asleep mid-flight?


00:26:15.130 --> 00:26:17.833
I... I... Hm.


00:26:17.867 --> 00:26:20.370
Exactly! Now chill.


00:26:20.403 --> 00:26:22.372
This thing took us further overnight


00:26:22.405 --> 00:26:23.973
than you could've ever flown.


00:26:24.006 --> 00:26:27.877
Oh, yeah? Then where's my family?


00:26:30.680 --> 00:26:32.382
If you really wanna know...


00:26:32.415 --> 00:26:34.850
What are you talking about?


00:26:34.884 --> 00:26:36.486
Just saying...


00:26:38.153 --> 00:26:40.456
They don't look anything like me.


00:26:40.490 --> 00:26:42.725
- Wow!
- Wow!


00:26:42.758 --> 00:26:46.629
- You're friends with an owl?
- Not friends!


00:26:46.662 --> 00:26:47.897
What?!


00:26:47.930 --> 00:26:51.867
Hi! I've never seen you before.


00:26:51.901 --> 00:26:54.370
A bunch of tourists just dumped
these tasty travel snacks.


00:26:54.404 --> 00:26:56.406
You guys hungry?


00:26:58.173 --> 00:27:01.477
I don't eat trash. I hunt and fish.


00:27:01.511 --> 00:27:03.913
- Oh...
- Suit yourself!


00:27:06.716 --> 00:27:09.385
- What brings you to France?
- Get this!


00:27:09.419 --> 00:27:11.987
He's going south, chasing his flock!


00:27:12.021 --> 00:27:14.890
But... we don't migrate.


00:27:14.924 --> 00:27:17.527
What kind of sparrow are you?


00:27:17.560 --> 00:27:20.530
I... I... I am a stork!


00:27:21.864 --> 00:27:24.867
- Wow. Huh?
- Hmm!


00:27:24.900 --> 00:27:26.402
Don't take it personal.


00:27:26.436 --> 00:27:29.004
He's a late bloomer.


00:27:29.038 --> 00:27:30.706
Oh...


00:27:33.709 --> 00:27:37.580
Poor things! Just wanted to say hi.


00:27:37.613 --> 00:27:41.451
No, thanks. Yeesh, so pushy!


00:27:41.484 --> 00:27:44.920
They're sparrows!
Pushy is their middle name.


00:27:44.954 --> 00:27:47.590
Can we get back to my family?


00:27:47.623 --> 00:27:50.125
Maybe we're close enough
to catch their scent by now.


00:27:50.159 --> 00:27:54.497
Talk about being pushy, right, Oleg?


00:27:54.530 --> 00:27:56.732
- Wait! You found them?
- Ooh!


00:27:56.766 --> 00:27:58.568
Go, Olga, go!


00:28:01.971 --> 00:28:03.806
Wait, this can't be right!


00:28:09.545 --> 00:28:11.814
Ah... what?


00:28:11.847 --> 00:28:14.950
Mein Hawk-Burger just flew away.


00:28:14.984 --> 00:28:18.488
What are you doing?


00:28:18.521 --> 00:28:20.656
Great, just great, Olga.


00:28:20.690 --> 00:28:22.492
My family could be
right around the corner


00:28:22.525 --> 00:28:25.495
and you're busy stuffing your beak!


00:28:25.528 --> 00:28:29.499
First things first, Oleg.
This stuff's magical!


00:28:35.938 --> 00:28:37.507
- Comment!
- Like!


00:28:37.540 --> 00:28:39.008
Huh?


00:28:39.041 --> 00:28:41.243
Fine, stay here.


00:28:41.276 --> 00:28:43.846
But, Oleg, all this delicious stuff!


00:28:46.115 --> 00:28:48.551
All right, all right!


00:28:51.020 --> 00:28:53.489
Hey, guys? Hey! Listen, you...


00:28:53.523 --> 00:28:55.491
- Aah!
- Have! You! Seen!


00:28:55.525 --> 00:28:56.692
A! Flock! Of! Storks!


00:28:56.726 --> 00:28:59.629
Aaah! Ouch!


00:28:59.662 --> 00:29:00.830
What was that?


00:29:00.863 --> 00:29:03.933
A sparrow just tried to hack me!


00:29:03.966 --> 00:29:05.835
Fail! What a troll.


00:29:05.868 --> 00:29:07.537
I'm a stork, got that?


00:29:07.570 --> 00:29:10.673
Not according to the Chick-a-pedia.


00:29:10.706 --> 00:29:13.042
- Ha ha ha. LOL!
- Like!


00:29:13.075 --> 00:29:16.812
- Hello? Someone there?!
- So, what's up?


00:29:16.846 --> 00:29:18.548
They must have fried their bird brains.


00:29:18.581 --> 00:29:20.049
Like!


00:29:20.082 --> 00:29:21.717
I'm wasting my time.


00:29:21.751 --> 00:29:24.520
Hmmm, I think I see how this works.


00:29:24.554 --> 00:29:26.956
- Love! Unfriend!
- Loading!


00:29:26.989 --> 00:29:29.659
Oh, what could possibly go wrong, Oleg?


00:29:29.692 --> 00:29:31.694
All you gotta do...


00:29:31.727 --> 00:29:32.828
Olga?!


00:29:32.862 --> 00:29:35.831
Suddenly I feel so...


00:29:35.865 --> 00:29:39.234
Connected!


00:29:39.268 --> 00:29:42.638
- Huh?
- OMG, an online owl.


00:29:42.672 --> 00:29:46.542
Olga! Can I friend you?


00:29:46.576 --> 00:29:47.909
- Me too! Me too!
- Me too! Me too!


00:29:47.910 --> 00:29:51.146
Uh... Sure! Wow!


00:29:51.180 --> 00:29:53.082
Six new friend requests already!


00:29:53.115 --> 00:29:56.552
- This is fun, Oleg!
- Ask them, Olga!


00:29:56.586 --> 00:29:58.020
Oh, oh, oh, right!


00:29:58.053 --> 00:30:01.023
Seen a flock of storks around?


00:30:01.056 --> 00:30:04.226
Storks? Non. Maybe someone else has.


00:30:04.259 --> 00:30:08.731
I'll check Facebeak.


00:30:08.764 --> 00:30:09.699
Aha!


00:30:09.732 --> 00:30:11.867
A friend of a friend
of a cousin's friend,


00:30:11.901 --> 00:30:14.336
- who I've actually blocked...
- Stalker!


00:30:14.369 --> 00:30:18.340
Says he spotted the storks
on their way to Gibraltar.


00:30:18.373 --> 00:30:20.876
Gibraltar! How do I get there?


00:30:20.910 --> 00:30:23.345
Shortest route or fewest wind farms?


00:30:23.378 --> 00:30:25.581
Never mind.


00:30:25.615 --> 00:30:27.917
I'll send Olga the coordinates...


00:30:28.951 --> 00:30:30.285
Ah!


00:30:30.319 --> 00:30:33.623
- Recalculating...
- Great! Let's go!


00:30:33.656 --> 00:30:35.190
Huh? Huh?


00:30:35.224 --> 00:30:38.861
- Olga?
- Ahh!


00:30:38.894 --> 00:30:40.362
He'll have to wait.


00:30:40.395 --> 00:30:43.265
I'm busy completing my profile!


00:30:43.298 --> 00:30:45.034
Come on, Olga!


00:30:45.067 --> 00:30:46.802
Lead the way!


00:30:49.972 --> 00:30:53.876
Just as I was getting to know her.


00:30:53.909 --> 00:30:55.878
I guess I'm back on the market.


00:30:55.911 --> 00:30:58.748
Like!


00:31:08.157 --> 00:31:12.227
Polly want a stale cracker?


00:31:12.261 --> 00:31:15.064
Because that's all you get
till you bring me customers!


00:31:15.097 --> 00:31:19.635
Sing, Kiki! Sing as if
your life depended on it!


00:31:19.669 --> 00:31:21.771
Which it does!


00:31:27.843 --> 00:31:31.781
♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪


00:31:31.814 --> 00:31:34.083
♪ I love you best... ♪


00:31:34.116 --> 00:31:35.818
Little green waste of space!


00:31:45.160 --> 00:31:47.830
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:31:47.863 --> 00:31:50.132
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:31:50.165 --> 00:31:53.803
♪ Got to let it show, ooh! ♪


00:31:53.836 --> 00:31:55.705
♪ There's a new me coming out... ♪


00:31:58.841 --> 00:32:01.110
Oh...


00:32:01.143 --> 00:32:04.814
- ♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪
- Cheap electronics.


00:32:04.847 --> 00:32:08.717
- ♪ I love you best... ♪
- If you don't shape up, I'm getting a cat!


00:32:10.786 --> 00:32:12.354
Mon Dieu!


00:32:12.387 --> 00:32:14.824
The Sanremo Festival begins tomorrow!


00:32:14.857 --> 00:32:17.893
<i>Attention! The express train
to Sanremo is arriving.</i>


00:32:17.927 --> 00:32:20.696
<i>It leaves immediately
after my coffee break.</i>


00:32:20.730 --> 00:32:22.364
Wait for me!


00:32:22.397 --> 00:32:24.734
I gotta get out of this prison!


00:32:24.767 --> 00:32:27.469
Help me, cracker, you're my only hope.


00:32:30.105 --> 00:32:34.009
Oh, no! I'm doomed!


00:32:34.043 --> 00:32:35.845
- OMG!
- Huh?


00:32:35.878 --> 00:32:38.914
Making friends is so much
easier than I thought!


00:32:38.948 --> 00:32:41.316
So, which way to Gibraltar?


00:32:41.350 --> 00:32:45.721
- Admit it! We're lost!
- It's not that.


00:32:45.755 --> 00:32:49.859
I have to show you.


00:32:49.892 --> 00:32:52.161
Thanks to Pigeon Maps,


00:32:52.194 --> 00:32:57.499
I got a bird's eye view on everything,
only from way up.


00:32:57.532 --> 00:33:01.804
We found you... here.
And... this...


00:33:01.837 --> 00:33:04.239
- is where you're headed.
- Africa!


00:33:04.273 --> 00:33:09.879
Totally. Thanks to Oleg and me,
we are this far already.


00:33:09.912 --> 00:33:11.747
But your storks, man?


00:33:11.781 --> 00:33:14.516
They're approaching Gibraltar over here!


00:33:14.549 --> 00:33:17.252
- That's a mighty long haul!
- So?


00:33:17.286 --> 00:33:20.389
Don't you see?
It would take us a week to get there.


00:33:20.422 --> 00:33:23.759
That's impossible!
You must've taken us the wrong way.


00:33:23.793 --> 00:33:27.262
Whoa! There's nothing
wrong with our senses.


00:33:27.296 --> 00:33:29.298
We're just not as fast as storks.


00:33:29.331 --> 00:33:31.901
And you know why?


00:33:31.934 --> 00:33:35.404
- Because we're not storks.
- That's the problem.


00:33:35.437 --> 00:33:37.973
You're not storks!
You're slowing me down.


00:33:38.007 --> 00:33:42.812
This kid is driving me bananas.


00:33:42.845 --> 00:33:45.848
There just has to be
a faster way to Gibraltar!


00:33:45.881 --> 00:33:50.552
That's my cue.


00:33:50.585 --> 00:33:53.488
Madame, monsieur?


00:33:53.522 --> 00:33:55.290
May I be of assistance?


00:33:55.324 --> 00:33:59.061
- Hmm?
- Aww! Look at you!


00:33:59.094 --> 00:34:03.966
The predator and its prey.
Need to get to Gibraltar?


00:34:03.999 --> 00:34:06.235
My name's Richard and this is Olga.


00:34:06.268 --> 00:34:11.807
- And? Ahem.
- Fine! Olga and Oleg.


00:34:11.841 --> 00:34:14.977
Quoi? Oh, I get it!


00:34:15.010 --> 00:34:17.947
- The owl's gone cuckoo.
- Cuckoo? Us?


00:34:17.980 --> 00:34:21.183
Richard's the one
who thinks he's a stork!


00:34:21.216 --> 00:34:24.586
Oh! Mmm...


00:34:24.619 --> 00:34:26.822
Of course he's a stork!


00:34:26.856 --> 00:34:30.592
The upright posture,
the inimitable elegance...


00:34:30.625 --> 00:34:32.962
- Muah!
- Finally!


00:34:32.995 --> 00:34:34.897
Someone who knows
what he's talking about.


00:34:36.631 --> 00:34:38.333
And just who are you?


00:34:38.367 --> 00:34:44.173
My apologies, Kiki La Spree,
disco parakeet fantastique!


00:34:44.206 --> 00:34:46.608
Ambassador to Sparkleville!


00:34:46.641 --> 00:34:48.443
Distinguished professor of...


00:34:48.477 --> 00:34:49.611
- Blabberbeak?
- Oh!


00:34:49.644 --> 00:34:52.547
I couldn't help but overhear
your little picking match.


00:34:52.581 --> 00:34:55.885
But don't despair.
I can get you to Gibraltar!


00:34:55.918 --> 00:35:00.555
I was headed there myself.
Isn't that an amazing coincidence?


00:35:00.589 --> 00:35:03.292
What does a cage bird want in Gibraltar?


00:35:03.325 --> 00:35:06.028
Why, I'm performing there!


00:35:06.061 --> 00:35:07.863
To welcome the migrating birds!


00:35:07.897 --> 00:35:11.000
At the... uh... Gibraltar Festival!


00:35:11.033 --> 00:35:13.568
Free me and we'll catch
a train out of here


00:35:13.602 --> 00:35:16.939
faster than you can say "Disco Duck"!


00:35:16.972 --> 00:35:18.640
But what's a... train?


00:35:20.442 --> 00:35:23.913
What the what? Ho ho!


00:35:23.946 --> 00:35:26.148
- Voilà.
- Whoa!


00:35:26.181 --> 00:35:29.051
<i>I'm halfway through my café Au lait,
so prepare to board.</i>


00:35:29.084 --> 00:35:31.420
- Oh, no! We have to hurry!
- What?


00:35:31.453 --> 00:35:35.224
He said the train to Gibraltar
is leaving tout de suite!


00:35:35.257 --> 00:35:36.926
You speak human?


00:35:36.959 --> 00:35:42.264
After a zillion hours of karaoke,
even you would, my frizzy feather ball.


00:35:42.297 --> 00:35:43.899
Makes us wonder


00:35:43.933 --> 00:35:46.035
what other tricks you've got
under your plumage.


00:35:46.068 --> 00:35:48.904
Come on, Olga!
Kiki needs our help!


00:35:48.938 --> 00:35:50.005
Merci.


00:35:50.039 --> 00:35:52.574
Now there's a lock underneath,
but be careful.


00:35:55.077 --> 00:35:57.947
- I said be careful!
- What's wrong?


00:35:57.980 --> 00:35:59.949
I am afraid of heights, all right?


00:35:59.982 --> 00:36:01.383
Help!


00:36:03.218 --> 00:36:06.055
- Oy!
- Am I dead?


00:36:06.088 --> 00:36:07.422
Not yet.


00:36:07.456 --> 00:36:10.059
I don't hear you singing!


00:36:10.092 --> 00:36:12.027
- What the...
- Olga! Get him out of here!


00:36:13.162 --> 00:36:16.531
I'm not getting my wings dirty!
You let him out!


00:36:16.565 --> 00:36:20.569
Out of my way! I've got you now!


00:36:23.172 --> 00:36:24.306
No!


00:36:25.975 --> 00:36:30.946
- Where are you taking me?
- Just keep quiet, can you?


00:36:30.980 --> 00:36:33.548
What kind of bird is afraid of flying?


00:36:33.582 --> 00:36:37.552
Flying is for the riff-raff.
I'm a songbird!


00:36:39.154 --> 00:36:42.091
Let go of me, you heartless harpy!


00:36:42.124 --> 00:36:43.625
Oh, okay.


00:36:43.658 --> 00:36:46.095
Just great!


00:36:46.128 --> 00:36:47.462
Hey, he asked me!


00:36:47.496 --> 00:36:50.132
Kiki! Just fly! You're a bird!


00:36:50.165 --> 00:36:53.102
- I can't! Aaaahh!
- Spread your wings!


00:36:53.135 --> 00:36:56.271
- Now taking my final sip...
- The train's leaving.


00:36:56.305 --> 00:36:59.141
- It's all over now.
- No!


00:36:59.174 --> 00:37:02.577
Just let me drop to my deaaaathhh...


00:37:02.611 --> 00:37:06.048
Make it stop!
Make it stop!


00:37:06.081 --> 00:37:08.083
Oh!


00:37:08.117 --> 00:37:10.252
Oh! Tulips!


00:37:14.156 --> 00:37:17.059
Great! Now I'm gonna get bird flu!


00:37:17.092 --> 00:37:19.528
- Huh?
- Help me!


00:37:19.561 --> 00:37:21.130
Birds!


00:37:26.201 --> 00:37:26.901
Oh, no!


00:37:26.935 --> 00:37:29.371
What?!


00:37:29.404 --> 00:37:31.706
That's our train over there!


00:37:31.740 --> 00:37:34.143
<i>All aboard for Sanremo!</i>


00:37:34.176 --> 00:37:37.379
Gibraltar, here we come!


00:38:04.139 --> 00:38:06.541
Dad! We can't keep going!


00:38:06.575 --> 00:38:09.044
- Everyone needs a break!
- No!


00:38:09.078 --> 00:38:10.579
We stick to the prescribed route!


00:38:10.612 --> 00:38:14.216
Can't we at least fly a little lower?


00:38:14.249 --> 00:38:17.186
No. Now keep the formation!


00:38:17.219 --> 00:38:20.589
Stay together, everyone!
Don't fall behind!


00:38:20.622 --> 00:38:23.258
- But Dad!
- Max! Do as I say!


00:38:42.277 --> 00:38:43.545
And when I woke up,


00:38:43.578 --> 00:38:46.148
my brother and my parents were...


00:38:46.181 --> 00:38:48.583
gone.


00:38:48.617 --> 00:38:51.720
I wish I had a dramatic
backstory like that.


00:38:51.753 --> 00:38:56.125
I always dreamed of escaping
my dreary surroundings


00:38:56.158 --> 00:38:59.228
to become a famous disco star!


00:38:59.261 --> 00:39:02.764
Loved... adored...


00:39:02.797 --> 00:39:05.167
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:39:05.200 --> 00:39:07.436
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:39:07.469 --> 00:39:09.538
♪ Got to let... Oh! ♪


00:39:09.571 --> 00:39:12.307
What is "disco," anyway?


00:39:12.341 --> 00:39:17.112
Some kind of courtship behavior
to attract a mate?


00:39:17.146 --> 00:39:18.313
Can be.


00:39:18.347 --> 00:39:21.716
Although I doubt you could
ever pull it off, darling.


00:39:21.750 --> 00:39:25.420
- Hmm!
- Hey!


00:39:25.454 --> 00:39:29.424
I'm used to it. I know
that I'm big and awkward.


00:39:31.293 --> 00:39:34.463
Well... didn't your mama
ever teach you to groom?


00:39:34.496 --> 00:39:37.166
Mmm...


00:39:37.199 --> 00:39:41.270
Let's just say my family
didn't exactly embrace me.


00:39:41.303 --> 00:39:44.239
Maybe with a smooth-out
and some feather-gel...


00:39:44.273 --> 00:39:46.141
Don't you see that I'm freakishly big?


00:39:46.175 --> 00:39:49.511
I've seen way bigger owls
on the Forest Channel.


00:39:49.544 --> 00:39:52.214
Yeah, but not pygmy owls.


00:39:52.247 --> 00:39:56.318
- Guess... uh... not...
- I just never fit in.


00:39:56.351 --> 00:39:59.354
- Sounds familiar.
- No!


00:40:03.958 --> 00:40:06.361
No, I literally didn't fit in.


00:40:06.395 --> 00:40:09.798
I mean, in the nest...


00:40:12.801 --> 00:40:16.605
Pygmy owls are supposed
to be tiny, not giant.


00:40:16.638 --> 00:40:18.072
A "giant pygmy"?


00:40:18.106 --> 00:40:20.709
- Is that like a "jumbo shrimp"?
- Shh!


00:40:26.581 --> 00:40:27.849
Ah!


00:40:35.657 --> 00:40:38.960
♪ Olga is a monster! Olga is a freak! ♪


00:40:48.670 --> 00:40:51.040
Oh... ohhh!


00:40:51.073 --> 00:40:54.609
My own family didn't give
a hoot about me.


00:41:02.851 --> 00:41:06.888
I didn't have a single friend
in the whole world.


00:41:09.324 --> 00:41:11.360
Mm? Mm?


00:41:11.393 --> 00:41:16.598
And then... I met Oleg.


00:41:17.799 --> 00:41:19.534
Ah!


00:41:28.410 --> 00:41:31.313
You've always been there for me.


00:41:31.346 --> 00:41:35.384
Awww... Ditto.


00:41:35.417 --> 00:41:37.786
Ahem. How can I put this?


00:41:37.819 --> 00:41:40.889
Some folks think, for someone to exist,


00:41:40.922 --> 00:41:42.724
you have to see them.


00:41:42.757 --> 00:41:45.794
It sounds kind of crazy, I know.


00:41:45.827 --> 00:41:47.362
Just leave us alone!


00:41:49.431 --> 00:41:51.300
- Nice.
- What?


00:41:54.936 --> 00:41:58.907
It's okay, Olga. I know how you feel.


00:42:00.942 --> 00:42:03.312
<i>Passengers, we will now dim the lights</i>


00:42:03.345 --> 00:42:05.547
<i>and wish you all a good night.</i>


00:42:05.580 --> 00:42:07.782
<i>We'll be in Sanremo in the morning.</i>


00:42:07.816 --> 00:42:09.384
Hmm?


00:42:09.418 --> 00:42:11.620
Uh, uh... He said...


00:42:11.653 --> 00:42:15.824
Uh, the breakfast buffet
has an omelet station


00:42:15.857 --> 00:42:17.826
and the toilet is backed up.


00:42:17.859 --> 00:42:21.430
Time for our beauty sleep!


00:42:21.463 --> 00:42:23.432
Good night!


00:42:27.035 --> 00:42:31.806
Here, hold on to me... if you want to.


00:42:39.047 --> 00:42:43.318
- Almost there.
- Uhh... Yeah.


00:42:43.352 --> 00:42:45.520
Good night, sweethearts.


00:43:12.381 --> 00:43:14.416
Don't feel guilty. Just go.


00:43:14.449 --> 00:43:18.820
Oh, I'm faker than a pair
of faux-leather stilettos.


00:43:18.853 --> 00:43:23.425
Oh, well, a diva has to do
what a diva has to do!


00:43:23.458 --> 00:43:24.458
Oh!


00:43:26.428 --> 00:43:29.531
What has she got in this thing, a piano?


00:43:29.564 --> 00:43:31.833
Oh...


00:43:31.866 --> 00:43:32.901
Kiki, we have to...


00:43:32.934 --> 00:43:34.369
- Kiki?
- Huh?!


00:43:34.403 --> 00:43:35.670
Birds!


00:43:35.704 --> 00:43:38.139
Shoo! Shoo, birds!


00:43:38.172 --> 00:43:40.542
Kiki?


00:43:40.575 --> 00:43:42.377
Kiki!


00:43:44.446 --> 00:43:46.014
Where are you?


00:43:46.047 --> 00:43:50.985
Forget him!
Let's just get outta... Here.


00:43:57.025 --> 00:43:59.528
- Well, if you saw the window, Oleg...
- Look out!


00:43:59.561 --> 00:44:01.162
Then why didn't you say something?


00:44:01.195 --> 00:44:03.598
- Oh!
- Wow. Owl coming through!


00:44:03.632 --> 00:44:05.534
Ooh!


00:44:05.567 --> 00:44:08.470
Oh! Oh, oh!


00:44:12.073 --> 00:44:15.477
Looks like you're not-a from here.


00:44:15.510 --> 00:44:18.680
Looks like-a you could use-a
some help from a local,


00:44:18.713 --> 00:44:22.784
like... Don Crowleone, sí?


00:44:22.817 --> 00:44:24.453
Well, I... eh...


00:44:24.486 --> 00:44:28.690
Hehe, I see you and it-a hit me
like a lasagna to the face!


00:44:28.723 --> 00:44:31.025
There's so many dangers
in this-a town...


00:44:31.059 --> 00:44:33.895
You gonna need-a someone
to a-look out for you, eh?


00:44:33.928 --> 00:44:35.497
Or you might run inta...


00:44:36.598 --> 00:44:39.100
Some very bad birds.


00:44:39.133 --> 00:44:40.969
- Hmm?
- So look.


00:44:41.002 --> 00:44:44.739
We protect you...
for a small-a fee, of course...


00:44:44.773 --> 00:44:48.577
so you can enjoy-a your stay in Sanremo.


00:44:48.610 --> 00:44:52.514
Huh? Sanremo? You mean Gibraltar.


00:44:52.547 --> 00:44:55.484
Scusi, Gibraltar?


00:44:57.018 --> 00:44:58.853
The bambino thinks he's in Gibraltar!
Ha ha!


00:45:00.689 --> 00:45:02.791
You're in beautiful Sanremo!


00:45:02.824 --> 00:45:04.626
- In Italia!
- W-what?


00:45:04.659 --> 00:45:08.062
Why you think-a we got-a
these-a wacky accents, ah?


00:45:08.096 --> 00:45:11.800
- Then where's Africa?
- Africa? Ha!


00:45:11.833 --> 00:45:15.604
- Way-a far away, over the sea.
- No!


00:45:15.637 --> 00:45:16.805
Don't try-a flyin' there,


00:45:16.838 --> 00:45:19.608
or you be swimmin' with the fishes.


00:45:20.742 --> 00:45:23.077
I knew that glittery green
schemer was up to no good!


00:45:23.111 --> 00:45:25.079
You mean-a the parakeet?


00:45:25.113 --> 00:45:27.081
I see him in-a big hurry.


00:45:27.115 --> 00:45:29.951
He asked-a how to get
to the Sanremo Festival.


00:45:29.984 --> 00:45:31.252
Weird little bird.


00:45:31.285 --> 00:45:33.655
Whaaaaat?! He used us!


00:45:33.688 --> 00:45:37.492
Sounds like you've been-a
had big-a-time, bambini.


00:45:37.526 --> 00:45:40.261
Hey!


00:45:40.294 --> 00:45:41.663
Richard!


00:45:41.696 --> 00:45:44.633
Shush!


00:45:46.735 --> 00:45:49.037
Wait... where are you going?


00:45:49.070 --> 00:45:51.640
How could Kiki do this?


00:45:51.673 --> 00:45:53.808
How am I going to reach my family now?


00:45:53.842 --> 00:45:56.545
No, Oleg! Hold your beak.


00:45:56.578 --> 00:45:58.547
It's time I straightened him out.


00:46:00.248 --> 00:46:03.284
You know what, Richard?
Maybe this will teach you.


00:46:03.317 --> 00:46:07.556
You're only in this mess 'cause you
won't accept what you really are.


00:46:07.589 --> 00:46:10.291
I really am totally sick
of arguing this!


00:46:10.324 --> 00:46:13.227
Fine! So then stop! Oleg, tell him!


00:46:13.261 --> 00:46:15.997
As if Oleg really existed!


00:46:16.030 --> 00:46:17.999
Leave him out of this, sparrow!


00:46:18.032 --> 00:46:21.035
Oleg's just in your head! Got it?!


00:46:21.069 --> 00:46:24.305
He's. Not. Real!


00:46:24.338 --> 00:46:26.140
La-la-la-la-la-la!
Aaah!


00:46:28.076 --> 00:46:30.879
Just great.


00:46:30.912 --> 00:46:32.681
My father had it right!


00:46:32.714 --> 00:46:35.617
Storks need to stay with their own kind.


00:46:35.650 --> 00:46:38.987
I never should've followed you. Gah!


00:46:39.020 --> 00:46:42.023
Fine! Go! Leave me!


00:46:42.056 --> 00:46:46.227
I don't need you! I don't need anyone!


00:46:46.260 --> 00:46:48.329
Oh, rats!


00:46:48.362 --> 00:46:52.000
No. I will not follow him!


00:46:52.033 --> 00:46:54.603
Ruffle your feathers
as much as you like.


00:46:54.636 --> 00:46:56.705
Whose side are you on?


00:46:56.738 --> 00:46:58.673
No, you listen, Mr. Do-gooder!


00:46:58.707 --> 00:47:01.342
Whose fault is it
that I'm in this mess, huh?


00:47:01.375 --> 00:47:04.846
You're nothing but trouble, Oleg.


00:47:04.879 --> 00:47:06.581
I wish we never met!


00:47:10.284 --> 00:47:13.622
Hm? Hm?


00:47:13.655 --> 00:47:16.057
Where did you go?


00:47:16.090 --> 00:47:18.026
Oleg?


00:47:21.663 --> 00:47:23.965
Oleg!


00:47:23.998 --> 00:47:27.636
Here! We love you!


00:47:27.669 --> 00:47:29.671
What's that fragrance?


00:47:29.704 --> 00:47:33.241
Why, it's the sweet smell
of superstardom!


00:47:33.274 --> 00:47:35.944
First prize, here I come! Huh?


00:47:35.977 --> 00:47:38.212
Who put this man-shaped mountain here?


00:47:38.246 --> 00:47:39.547
<i>Attenzione!</i>


00:47:39.580 --> 00:47:43.117
<i>All songbirds to the roof
for the Sanremo festival!</i>


00:47:43.151 --> 00:47:44.653
Oh!


00:47:44.686 --> 00:47:47.956
Why do bird events always
have to be high up?


00:47:47.989 --> 00:47:50.625
One... wing in front of the... other.


00:47:51.860 --> 00:47:54.629
Registrazione!


00:47:54.663 --> 00:47:58.132
Registrazione for the
birdsong festival here-a!


00:47:58.166 --> 00:48:01.035
It is showtime!


00:48:03.037 --> 00:48:06.407
Somebody's got to know
the way to Africa around here.


00:48:06.440 --> 00:48:08.977
Storks!


00:48:11.445 --> 00:48:12.681
Hello?


00:48:16.017 --> 00:48:17.919
Hello?


00:48:20.822 --> 00:48:23.958
Anybody home?


00:48:27.361 --> 00:48:29.163
Anybody?


00:48:38.172 --> 00:48:41.375
They must be in Africa by now.


00:48:41.409 --> 00:48:42.877
Aw...


00:48:47.381 --> 00:48:48.717
Oleg!


00:48:50.885 --> 00:48:52.721
Where are you?


00:48:52.754 --> 00:48:54.756
I didn't mean it!


00:48:55.857 --> 00:48:57.759
Come back!


00:49:00.028 --> 00:49:01.462
Post!


00:49:01.495 --> 00:49:04.699
- Share!
- Posting!


00:49:04.733 --> 00:49:07.468
You guys gotta help me!


00:49:07.501 --> 00:49:08.569
I'm looking for Oleg!


00:49:08.602 --> 00:49:12.974
I lost him. I lost Richard.
I lost all my friends.


00:49:13.007 --> 00:49:17.646
Wait! Aren't you that weirdo
owl we heard about online?


00:49:17.679 --> 00:49:19.548
The one who was chasing a sparrow


00:49:19.581 --> 00:49:22.584
- who thought he was a stork?
- Yes! That's me!


00:49:22.617 --> 00:49:24.653
Uh... except for the "weirdo part".


00:49:24.686 --> 00:49:25.554
That's-a you?


00:49:25.587 --> 00:49:28.890
You're-a trending like-a mad! Plug in.


00:49:28.923 --> 00:49:31.693
Yeah. We got-a the hi-speed cable.


00:49:31.726 --> 00:49:33.528
Um, okay.


00:49:33.562 --> 00:49:34.863
But... only for a second.


00:49:34.896 --> 00:49:36.898
Hopefully somebody's seen my friends.


00:49:38.900 --> 00:49:43.004
High speed! Life in the fast lane!


00:49:43.037 --> 00:49:44.539
Told ya!


00:49:44.573 --> 00:49:46.808
Okay, now let's find Oleg.


00:49:47.909 --> 00:49:52.180
OMG! I got 3012 friend requests?!


00:49:53.447 --> 00:49:55.900
Would you mind confirming
my friend request first?


00:49:55.902 --> 00:49:56.719
Mmm?


00:49:56.751 --> 00:49:57.485
Yeah! Mine too!


00:49:57.518 --> 00:50:02.591
Sure! I'll confirm all of them!


00:50:02.624 --> 00:50:03.825
- So many...
- Like!


00:50:03.858 --> 00:50:05.694
- New friends!
- Post!


00:50:08.630 --> 00:50:11.265
Mmm. This is it!


00:50:11.299 --> 00:50:13.635
Your magic moment!


00:50:13.668 --> 00:50:17.739
<i>Welcome to the Sanremo Festival!</i>


00:50:17.772 --> 00:50:20.274
If only I had some friends
to cheer for me.


00:50:20.308 --> 00:50:24.946
<i>And-a now we open the show
with an all-time disco classic.</i>


00:50:24.979 --> 00:50:28.349
Oh, well, the show must go on.


00:50:28.382 --> 00:50:30.585
<i>It's the parakeet
with the tweet so sweet...</i>


00:50:30.619 --> 00:50:33.087
<i>The stunningly gorgeous...</i>


00:50:33.121 --> 00:50:35.624
<i>The breathtakingly beautiful...</i>


00:50:35.657 --> 00:50:37.859
- Koko!
- Oh! What?!


00:50:37.892 --> 00:50:40.061
No, no, no! My name is...


00:50:40.094 --> 00:50:43.197
- Performers only!
- That's what I am!


00:50:43.231 --> 00:50:44.733
Oh, oh, please, please...


00:50:44.766 --> 00:50:47.135
- Oh... no!
- Oh, my!


00:50:47.168 --> 00:50:50.739
Mille grazie!
Mille grazie!


00:50:50.772 --> 00:50:53.041
- ♪ I'm... ♪
- Argh! It can't be!


00:50:53.074 --> 00:50:54.643
- I have to get up there...
- ♪ Coming ♪


00:50:54.676 --> 00:50:56.110
- Ah-ah-ah!
- ♪ Out ♪


00:50:56.144 --> 00:50:58.079
But that's my song!


00:50:58.112 --> 00:51:00.048
♪ I'm coming ♪


00:51:00.081 --> 00:51:02.316
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:02.350 --> 00:51:04.653
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:04.686 --> 00:51:07.155
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:08.790 --> 00:51:10.792
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


00:51:10.825 --> 00:51:12.727
♪ And I just had to live ♪


00:51:12.761 --> 00:51:14.295
♪ And I want to give... ♪


00:51:28.376 --> 00:51:33.682
I can do this! Hmm!


00:51:36.685 --> 00:51:39.120
♪ ...got to let it show ♪


00:51:39.153 --> 00:51:42.023
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:42.056 --> 00:51:44.425
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:44.458 --> 00:51:47.028
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:50.865 --> 00:51:52.701
- Go on!
- Yeah!


00:51:52.734 --> 00:51:55.670
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:55.704 --> 00:51:57.672
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:57.706 --> 00:51:59.040
♪ Got to let it show... ♪


00:52:00.341 --> 00:52:01.876
<i>Attenzione, passengers!</i>


00:52:01.910 --> 00:52:07.148
<i>Ferry departs to Tunis, Africa, Pier 12.</i>


00:52:10.719 --> 00:52:14.288
Oh, ferry to Africa... pfft!


00:52:14.322 --> 00:52:17.959
This dreamboat's got
nothing left to twirl for.


00:52:17.992 --> 00:52:24.198
Au revoir, fame!
Bonjour, oblivion!


00:52:24.232 --> 00:52:26.868
Luigi! Everybody's at-a the cliffs!


00:52:26.901 --> 00:52:30.872
A sparrow wants to fly
across-a da sea to Africa!


00:52:30.905 --> 00:52:34.142
But-a that's-a crazy dangerous!


00:52:34.175 --> 00:52:36.711
Great! Let's-a go!


00:52:37.879 --> 00:52:40.749
Richard?


00:52:40.782 --> 00:52:43.885
Oh! I've got to stop him!


00:52:47.121 --> 00:52:51.025
Oh, I can't, I just can't!


00:52:51.059 --> 00:52:54.729
But Richard needs me! Ah! Eh!


00:52:54.763 --> 00:52:59.700
Here comes Kiki! Whoa! Whoa!


00:53:01.803 --> 00:53:05.874
Oh, no, no, no!
It'll be all right, Richard!


00:53:12.914 --> 00:53:15.750
Good job, little piggy!


00:53:16.918 --> 00:53:19.754
Olga?! Oh! Oh!


00:53:19.788 --> 00:53:23.892
For the love of Donna Summer,
what are you doing?


00:53:25.860 --> 00:53:28.296
I'm tilling my virtual farm.


00:53:28.329 --> 00:53:30.799
Leave her alone,
or I'll block-a your access!


00:53:30.832 --> 00:53:33.902
# PeskyParakeet!


00:53:33.935 --> 00:53:35.436
Oh... oh!


00:53:35.469 --> 00:53:37.772
Re-post!


00:53:42.010 --> 00:53:43.144
What have you done?


00:53:43.177 --> 00:53:45.279
Let's find another hotspot, quick!


00:53:45.313 --> 00:53:47.882
Dislike!


00:53:47.916 --> 00:53:49.450
- Richard needs our help!
- You!


00:53:49.483 --> 00:53:51.953
Why should I trust you?


00:53:51.986 --> 00:53:53.988
You tricked me once already,


00:53:54.022 --> 00:53:59.460
you deceitful, manipulative
superficial parakeet!


00:53:59.493 --> 00:54:02.063
Richard thinks he can fly
across the sea all by himself!


00:54:02.096 --> 00:54:04.498
But he'll never make it!


00:54:04.532 --> 00:54:06.868
We go to stop him!


00:54:06.901 --> 00:54:10.304
He left me, just like Oleg did.
Why should I care?


00:54:10.338 --> 00:54:12.841
Because you're friends!


00:54:12.874 --> 00:54:14.943
- Oh...
- Aw.


00:54:14.976 --> 00:54:17.812
Richard needs you. It's true.


00:54:17.846 --> 00:54:19.948
Ooh... ooh... ahh!


00:54:19.981 --> 00:54:22.951
I'll break your groove-thing


00:54:22.984 --> 00:54:24.819
if this is another one of your tricks!


00:54:24.853 --> 00:54:28.122
Eat me alive if you want! Just hurry!


00:54:28.156 --> 00:54:31.259
- Come on!
- I got you.


00:54:31.292 --> 00:54:32.827
Man, you're heavy for a parakeet.


00:54:32.861 --> 00:54:34.262
Said the giantess?


00:54:46.941 --> 00:54:48.242
Whoa!


00:54:48.276 --> 00:54:51.846
Hurry! That wacky sparrow's
a-gonna jump offa da cliff!


00:54:51.880 --> 00:54:55.383
With those-a winds?
He's-a cuckoo!


00:54:55.416 --> 00:54:57.618
I bet-a you three
herrings he goes-a splat.


00:54:57.651 --> 00:54:58.786
- Huh?
- You're on!


00:54:58.819 --> 00:55:02.290
- You can do it!
- Come on! Do it!


00:55:06.895 --> 00:55:08.362
- Jump!
- Come on!


00:55:08.396 --> 00:55:12.000
- Richard!
- Don't jump!


00:55:12.033 --> 00:55:15.003
We had a bet!


00:55:15.036 --> 00:55:16.537
Can't you see I'm busy here?


00:55:16.570 --> 00:55:18.472
No, Richard! It will kill you!


00:55:18.506 --> 00:55:21.242
- Yeah!
- Forgive me, please!


00:55:21.275 --> 00:55:24.012
I know I've been despicable.


00:55:24.045 --> 00:55:27.081
I beg you. Let me make it up to you!


00:55:27.115 --> 00:55:29.083
- Jump!
- Do it, do it, do it!


00:55:29.117 --> 00:55:32.653
I've lost Oleg already.
I can't lose you too!


00:55:32.686 --> 00:55:36.557
There's a safe way across to Africa.
A ferry!


00:55:36.590 --> 00:55:38.526
It's like a train that floats on water.


00:55:38.559 --> 00:55:40.995
No. I am a stork!


00:55:41.029 --> 00:55:42.897
Time I started acting like one.


00:55:48.069 --> 00:55:49.670
Richard!


00:55:54.943 --> 00:55:56.277
Just great.


00:55:56.310 --> 00:55:58.579
See you big boys over the rainbow!


00:55:59.747 --> 00:56:03.952
I bet-a you six herring
the green one chokes first.


00:56:07.255 --> 00:56:09.958
- Spread your wings!
- I can't! I can't!


00:56:12.126 --> 00:56:14.595
Heeeeere I cooooome!


00:56:26.340 --> 00:56:29.077
- There they go!
- Ho ho, yeah!


00:56:29.110 --> 00:56:34.082
- Pay up!
- Fine.


00:56:39.120 --> 00:56:41.055
Are we going down or up?


00:56:41.089 --> 00:56:44.025
We'll know if we crash and drown!


00:56:49.497 --> 00:56:52.133
Oh?


00:56:52.166 --> 00:56:53.634
Wow!


00:56:53.667 --> 00:56:56.004
This is amazing!


00:56:56.037 --> 00:56:59.140
Dazzle-tastic!


00:56:59.173 --> 00:57:02.610
This is definitely going in my memoirs.


00:57:02.643 --> 00:57:05.413
Too beautiful to stand!


00:57:05.446 --> 00:57:08.282
Right, Oleg? Oh.


00:57:08.316 --> 00:57:09.350
Mmm...


00:57:09.383 --> 00:57:12.987
Oh, wow...


00:57:13.021 --> 00:57:16.024
Oh...


00:57:16.057 --> 00:57:19.994
Africa, here we cooome!


00:57:34.208 --> 00:57:38.746
Look, a shooting star!
Everybody make a wish.


00:57:45.719 --> 00:57:50.158
That is no shooting star!


00:57:50.191 --> 00:57:52.493
And definitely not what I wished for!


00:57:57.365 --> 00:58:01.035
Darnit, not again.
There's something on the scope.


00:58:12.080 --> 00:58:15.083
Running on a plane
was not on my bucket list!


00:58:15.116 --> 00:58:17.818
Stay together!


00:58:20.221 --> 00:58:22.190
Olgaaaa!


00:58:29.730 --> 00:58:32.200
Where is Olga?


00:58:32.233 --> 00:58:33.734
Over there!


00:58:33.767 --> 00:58:38.439
- Olga!
- We'll save you, darling!


00:58:45.279 --> 00:58:46.847
Whoa!


00:58:46.880 --> 00:58:48.549
We have to find somewhere to land.


00:58:50.184 --> 00:58:52.720
In the middle of the sea?!


00:58:52.753 --> 00:58:54.288
There! What's that?


00:58:54.322 --> 00:58:56.424
An ocean liner!


00:59:02.130 --> 00:59:03.130
Whoo!


00:59:15.443 --> 00:59:19.280
I always wanted to learn
synchronized swimming.


00:59:19.313 --> 00:59:22.116
Olga!


00:59:22.150 --> 00:59:24.285
Darling!


00:59:24.318 --> 00:59:25.453
No!


00:59:33.227 --> 00:59:35.296
Oh!


00:59:35.329 --> 00:59:37.898
Olga! Come on! Get up!


00:59:37.931 --> 00:59:41.469
I know what to do!


00:59:43.171 --> 00:59:45.906
First aid poster.


00:59:45.939 --> 00:59:48.309
I stared at the thing for years.


00:59:48.342 --> 00:59:52.280
Come on. Olga, come on!


00:59:52.313 --> 00:59:55.549
Oh... oh...


00:59:59.320 --> 01:00:04.325
It's... too late.


01:00:04.358 --> 01:00:06.194
No.


01:00:13.501 --> 01:00:15.603
Oleg?


01:00:15.636 --> 01:00:18.339
Please...


01:00:18.372 --> 01:00:19.673
Can you help her?


01:00:22.643 --> 01:00:25.679
It's all my fault, and I'm sorry.


01:00:27.481 --> 01:00:29.783
Please bring her back!


01:00:29.817 --> 01:00:32.253
She needs you more than ever, Oleg.


01:00:48.236 --> 01:00:50.638
Ah...


01:00:50.671 --> 01:00:52.340
- Oh...
- Huh?


01:00:52.373 --> 01:00:55.276
- Oleg? Is that you?
- Ha ha!


01:00:55.309 --> 01:00:58.212
- Yes!
- All right, yes! You're back!


01:01:00.414 --> 01:01:04.352
Whoa!


01:01:04.385 --> 01:01:07.688
Eww! Oh...


01:01:07.721 --> 01:01:11.659
This is the best gift I've ever gotten!


01:01:11.692 --> 01:01:14.728
Oh...


01:01:14.762 --> 01:01:17.298
Missed you, too, Oleg.


01:01:25.473 --> 01:01:31.011
This... is the life.


01:01:31.044 --> 01:01:34.282
"Indulge yourself in our luxury spa,


01:01:34.315 --> 01:01:37.418
with 'all-you-can-heat'
sauna privileges,


01:01:37.451 --> 01:01:39.920
as we near our destination of..."


01:01:39.953 --> 01:01:41.088
Hey!


01:01:41.121 --> 01:01:45.459
You'll never guess where
we're headed, tweethearts!


01:01:45.493 --> 01:01:46.960
Africa!


01:01:46.994 --> 01:01:49.397
You can join the other storks after all!


01:01:49.430 --> 01:01:51.399
Ahem. Mm.


01:01:51.432 --> 01:01:54.001
Huh? Oh...


01:01:55.836 --> 01:01:59.707
"Other storks"?


01:01:59.740 --> 01:02:02.276
Claudius was right.


01:02:02.310 --> 01:02:05.746
You all were. I'm not a stork.


01:02:05.779 --> 01:02:08.349
I'll never be one.


01:02:08.382 --> 01:02:11.251
I'm just a sparrow.


01:02:15.923 --> 01:02:18.492
You really love them, don't you?


01:02:18.526 --> 01:02:19.993
Your storks.


01:02:20.027 --> 01:02:22.763
Mm-hmm.


01:02:22.796 --> 01:02:26.467
Then I say we show them
who you really are.


01:02:26.500 --> 01:02:30.471
But... what if they don't want me?


01:02:30.504 --> 01:02:34.308
There's only one way to find out.


01:02:34.342 --> 01:02:37.077
Are... are you sure?


01:02:37.110 --> 01:02:39.480
- Mm-hmm.
- Otherwise, I'll adopt!


01:02:39.513 --> 01:02:42.015
Oh!


01:02:44.485 --> 01:02:46.620
I just did a Gloria half-Gainer!


01:02:46.654 --> 01:02:48.489
Come on, bird of paradise.


01:02:48.522 --> 01:02:50.824
Let's find a place to sleep it off.


01:02:50.858 --> 01:02:51.959
All right.


01:02:51.992 --> 01:02:54.628
Hey, maybe there's a disco on this tub!


01:03:06.374 --> 01:03:08.376
Hmm.


01:03:11.812 --> 01:03:15.349
Storks! Prepare to land!


01:03:15.383 --> 01:03:18.652
We can rest here until the heat passes.


01:03:20.388 --> 01:03:23.491
Ahh, what a lovely death gulley!


01:03:23.524 --> 01:03:26.494
But... there was water here last year!


01:03:26.527 --> 01:03:28.061
I'm never wrong about these things!


01:03:28.095 --> 01:03:29.997
The riverbed dried up.


01:03:30.030 --> 01:03:34.502
Humans built another one
of their stupid dams.


01:03:35.569 --> 01:03:38.372
I know some other water
holes around here.


01:03:38.406 --> 01:03:40.508
I could show you, if you like.


01:03:40.541 --> 01:03:44.645
Thank you, sir, but your
assistance is not required.


01:03:44.678 --> 01:03:45.879
Hmm.


01:03:45.913 --> 01:03:49.417
Yeah? Fine. Storks!


01:03:49.450 --> 01:03:52.653
I'll go find water. Do not wander off.


01:03:52.686 --> 01:03:55.756
You could've accepted his help.
He seemed nice.


01:03:55.789 --> 01:03:58.559
Our flock can take care of itself.


01:03:58.592 --> 01:04:00.060
I know what I'm doing.


01:04:00.093 --> 01:04:03.697
Yeah... I can see that.


01:04:03.731 --> 01:04:06.166
You will not speak to me
in this way, Max!


01:04:06.199 --> 01:04:07.601
Stop it, will you?


01:04:07.635 --> 01:04:10.538
I'm only being reasonable,


01:04:10.571 --> 01:04:13.541
and doing what is best for all of us.


01:04:13.574 --> 01:04:15.108
All of us? Really?


01:04:15.142 --> 01:04:17.578
Even my little brother?!


01:04:17.611 --> 01:04:19.447
- You just don't get it!
- Max!


01:04:19.480 --> 01:04:22.182
Stay with the flock!


01:04:22.215 --> 01:04:24.952
Go after him!


01:04:24.985 --> 01:04:27.387
Max!


01:04:32.125 --> 01:04:34.595
Big mean dummy.


01:04:34.628 --> 01:04:36.864
Jerk.


01:04:36.897 --> 01:04:38.632
It's a dangerous place!


01:04:38.666 --> 01:04:40.434
I hate you!


01:04:41.969 --> 01:04:44.104
Oh? Oh!


01:04:50.110 --> 01:04:52.646
He-hello?


01:04:52.680 --> 01:04:53.914
Who's there...


01:04:57.618 --> 01:05:00.454
Max? My boy?


01:05:06.494 --> 01:05:08.829
I can't believe we're in Tangier!


01:05:10.598 --> 01:05:12.733
Africa!


01:05:14.535 --> 01:05:16.136
Hot stuff! Ooh, baby!


01:05:16.169 --> 01:05:18.171
Which way to the Great Lake, Olga?


01:05:18.205 --> 01:05:20.508
Hm... let's see.


01:05:20.541 --> 01:05:21.475
Richard!


01:05:21.509 --> 01:05:23.844
You're that sparrow
who thinks he's a stork!


01:05:23.877 --> 01:05:25.846
We have some good news for you.


01:05:25.879 --> 01:05:28.148
- Your flock is nearby!
- Oh!


01:05:28.181 --> 01:05:30.117
Just in!


01:05:30.150 --> 01:05:31.985
They're, like, totally in trouble!


01:05:32.019 --> 01:05:34.655
A-something about
the Flock Leader's son...


01:05:34.688 --> 01:05:36.156
"Wax"?


01:05:36.189 --> 01:05:37.525
Max!


01:05:37.558 --> 01:05:38.425
That's the one!


01:05:38.458 --> 01:05:41.161
He vanished without a trace.


01:05:41.194 --> 01:05:43.263
- By the oasis.
- Oasis?


01:05:43.296 --> 01:05:44.765
I need to get there now!


01:05:44.798 --> 01:05:47.167
Er, maybe we could take him, darling.


01:05:47.200 --> 01:05:50.838
- It's not that far.
- What?! Get offline?!


01:05:50.871 --> 01:05:52.706
Did you catch a virus?


01:05:52.740 --> 01:05:54.542
Come on! Hurry! Please!


01:05:54.575 --> 01:05:56.977
We got to help him, snookums!


01:05:59.547 --> 01:06:01.882
Hey! This is better than I remembered!


01:06:01.915 --> 01:06:03.717
Come, my lovebird!


01:06:03.751 --> 01:06:06.620
Never! I'll miss a personality quiz!


01:06:06.654 --> 01:06:08.221
- Whoa!
- Trust me.


01:06:08.255 --> 01:06:09.890
You don't want to miss this.


01:06:14.227 --> 01:06:17.731
Everything's so... real!


01:06:17.765 --> 01:06:19.900
- Hurry! To the oasis!
- Love!


01:06:19.933 --> 01:06:24.672
Oh, well! There goes my vacation.


01:06:24.705 --> 01:06:26.674
Oh, I wish I'd brought my sunglasses!


01:06:30.277 --> 01:06:32.680
Max!


01:06:32.713 --> 01:06:36.684
Max!


01:06:36.717 --> 01:06:40.621
It's impossible!


01:06:40.654 --> 01:06:42.556
If only that boy had listened to me...


01:06:42.590 --> 01:06:44.858
- What are we going to do?
- I don't know what else...


01:06:44.892 --> 01:06:46.794
Where is Max?!


01:06:50.030 --> 01:06:52.332
Richard?


01:06:52.365 --> 01:06:54.702
How... how can that be?


01:06:54.735 --> 01:06:57.705
Mom! What happened to Max?


01:06:57.738 --> 01:06:58.772
He ran away.


01:06:58.806 --> 01:07:00.641
And... and we found his footsteps,


01:07:00.674 --> 01:07:02.242
leading into this tunnel.


01:07:02.275 --> 01:07:05.012
I tried everything,
but I couldn't get in.


01:07:05.045 --> 01:07:07.915
Not good... Not good at all.


01:07:07.948 --> 01:07:11.885
This is the entrance to the honey
badger's underground lair.


01:07:11.919 --> 01:07:14.788
Honey badger doesn't
sound so bad, right?


01:07:14.822 --> 01:07:16.624
Yeah! I'm gonna get Max out of there.


01:07:16.657 --> 01:07:17.791
Oh, no!


01:07:17.825 --> 01:07:20.894
The honey badger's the most
fearless predator of all.


01:07:20.928 --> 01:07:24.197
Instant death is pretty much a given.


01:07:24.231 --> 01:07:27.735
- Uh-huh? How would you know?
- Basic cable.


01:07:27.768 --> 01:07:29.803
- Ah.
- Okay, I'm going in.


01:07:29.837 --> 01:07:31.939
No! It's too dangerous for you...


01:07:31.972 --> 01:07:33.607
We have no other choice!


01:07:33.641 --> 01:07:36.143
You storks don't fit
through that entrance.


01:07:36.176 --> 01:07:37.745
We're coming with you!


01:07:37.778 --> 01:07:41.114
We'll show this badger
some honey, right, Kiki?


01:07:41.148 --> 01:07:42.816
Right, Kiki?!


01:07:42.850 --> 01:07:46.787
Remind me again why I'm signing
up for this kamikaze mission?


01:07:48.021 --> 01:07:50.658
Because you tricked us and you feel bad.


01:07:50.691 --> 01:07:53.326
Oh. Yeah. Count me in.


01:07:54.828 --> 01:07:56.764
- Richard!
- What?!


01:07:56.797 --> 01:08:02.402
Be careful. Please.


01:08:02.435 --> 01:08:03.771
Hmm.


01:08:09.342 --> 01:08:11.779
I'll guard the entrance!


01:08:20.688 --> 01:08:22.756
Oh, this was a bad idea.


01:08:25.358 --> 01:08:26.860
And I know bad ideas.


01:08:26.894 --> 01:08:28.862
"Bad idea" is my middle name!


01:08:28.896 --> 01:08:31.131
Shh!


01:08:32.399 --> 01:08:34.768
I'm a disco-lover, not a badger-fighter!


01:08:34.802 --> 01:08:36.870
Oh!


01:08:38.205 --> 01:08:39.740
He must be this way.


01:08:39.773 --> 01:08:43.376
Good. So let's go...


01:08:43.410 --> 01:08:44.678
that way.


01:08:44.712 --> 01:08:45.813
Okay, okay!


01:08:49.016 --> 01:08:51.685
That's slightly creepy.


01:08:51.719 --> 01:08:55.723
Is that... Max?


01:08:55.756 --> 01:08:58.726
That look like bird bones to you?


01:08:58.759 --> 01:09:01.962
How should I know? I'm vegan.


01:09:01.995 --> 01:09:04.998
And I'm a meat-eater. Remember that.


01:09:10.003 --> 01:09:12.873
So, ah, you guys give any more thought


01:09:12.906 --> 01:09:15.142
to my "running away" idea?


01:09:15.175 --> 01:09:18.411
Everyone, take a tunnel.
But be silent, okay?


01:09:19.847 --> 01:09:21.681
That means you, Showtune.


01:09:23.016 --> 01:09:25.018
- Hey!
- Shh!


01:09:25.052 --> 01:09:26.219
Take your tunnel!


01:09:26.253 --> 01:09:28.922
Can't we at least flip a coin?


01:09:28.956 --> 01:09:30.157
Shake a tailfeather!


01:09:31.759 --> 01:09:34.962
Well, at least I'll leave
a gorgeous corpse.


01:09:38.866 --> 01:09:40.768
Max?


01:09:43.904 --> 01:09:44.904
Max?


01:09:58.485 --> 01:09:59.887
Hmm.


01:10:02.956 --> 01:10:04.257
Mmm, hearty crunch.


01:10:04.291 --> 01:10:07.260
With a delightfully gooey center.


01:10:07.294 --> 01:10:09.296
Max?


01:10:09.329 --> 01:10:11.031
Whoa!


01:10:25.278 --> 01:10:27.380
Max!


01:10:27.414 --> 01:10:29.116
Is he okay?


01:10:29.149 --> 01:10:30.918
Phew!


01:10:32.585 --> 01:10:36.089
- Get up, Max!
- Oh.


01:10:36.123 --> 01:10:39.893
Oh? Little brother?


01:10:39.927 --> 01:10:42.930
Oh! How did you... get here?


01:10:42.963 --> 01:10:46.834
Shh! We've gotta get you out of here.


01:10:46.867 --> 01:10:47.935
Where's Kiki?


01:10:47.968 --> 01:10:50.971
Oh, great.


01:10:51.004 --> 01:10:54.174
My dry-cleaning bill is
going to be astronomical!


01:11:00.047 --> 01:11:01.915
I'm seeing double. Triple. Quadruple!


01:11:05.618 --> 01:11:09.990
Running away! Running away!


01:11:13.861 --> 01:11:15.896
- It's him!
- Ooops! Sorry.


01:11:15.929 --> 01:11:16.897
Great.


01:11:16.930 --> 01:11:18.198
This way out!


01:11:20.033 --> 01:11:21.902
Which tunnel?


01:11:23.871 --> 01:11:24.905
This one looks good!


01:11:27.340 --> 01:11:28.976
Kiki!


01:11:32.012 --> 01:11:34.481
I'm too colorful to die!


01:11:43.490 --> 01:11:45.192
Oh!


01:11:48.428 --> 01:11:51.064
♪ Monsieur Honey Badger! ♪


01:11:51.098 --> 01:11:52.098
Huh?


01:11:53.333 --> 01:11:55.969
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


01:11:56.003 --> 01:11:58.038
♪ And I just had to live ♪


01:11:58.071 --> 01:11:59.907
♪ And I wanna give ♪


01:11:59.940 --> 01:12:02.042
♪ I'm completely positive ♪


01:12:02.075 --> 01:12:04.011
♪ I think this time around ♪


01:12:04.044 --> 01:12:06.013
♪ I am gonna do it ♪


01:12:06.046 --> 01:12:08.381
♪ Like you never knew it ♪


01:12:08.415 --> 01:12:10.884
♪ Ooh, I'll make it through ♪


01:12:10.918 --> 01:12:12.038
♪ The time has come for me ♪


01:12:12.052 --> 01:12:13.987
♪ To break out of this shell ♪


01:12:14.021 --> 01:12:16.389
♪ I have to shout ♪


01:12:16.423 --> 01:12:17.991
♪ I am coming out ♪


01:12:18.025 --> 01:12:19.559
Huh?


01:12:24.364 --> 01:12:26.934
Olga, Kiki! Get Max out of here!


01:12:26.967 --> 01:12:28.168
But what about you?


01:12:28.201 --> 01:12:29.469
Just do it!


01:12:34.607 --> 01:12:36.676
- Just my luck.
- A dead end?


01:12:36.709 --> 01:12:39.346
Everybody, keep looking!


01:12:39.379 --> 01:12:42.082
There must be another way to get in!


01:12:42.115 --> 01:12:44.217
- Huh?
- Dad! Mom!


01:12:44.251 --> 01:12:46.053
- We're here!
- Max!


01:12:46.086 --> 01:12:47.654
Dig here!


01:12:51.591 --> 01:12:54.194
Ahh! Beaks!


01:12:54.227 --> 01:12:57.564
- Ah!
- Ouch!


01:12:59.099 --> 01:13:01.301
Son! Oh!


01:13:01.334 --> 01:13:03.103
I'm so sorry.


01:13:03.136 --> 01:13:04.604
Dad! Richard's still in there.


01:13:04.637 --> 01:13:05.705
No!


01:13:17.750 --> 01:13:19.086
Ah!


01:13:20.487 --> 01:13:21.989
Richard! Get out of there!


01:13:28.996 --> 01:13:31.398
Don't you touch him, you beast!


01:13:37.670 --> 01:13:41.041
- It's collapsing!
- That cave wasn't up to code!


01:13:44.611 --> 01:13:46.013
Oh!


01:13:46.046 --> 01:13:48.982
Here, honey bunny!


01:13:49.016 --> 01:13:51.518
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


01:14:04.031 --> 01:14:05.999
Oh!


01:14:29.656 --> 01:14:31.324
Richard!


01:14:31.358 --> 01:14:33.360
Where... where is he?


01:14:34.827 --> 01:14:36.529
- Richard?
- Come on out!


01:14:39.066 --> 01:14:42.069
Can you see him, Oleg?


01:14:42.102 --> 01:14:44.304
Oh, no.


01:14:57.684 --> 01:15:00.420
Huh?


01:15:02.622 --> 01:15:04.724
Do you see what I see?


01:15:04.757 --> 01:15:06.593
What?


01:15:10.563 --> 01:15:12.132
Richard!


01:15:12.165 --> 01:15:14.367
- Oh!
- It's Richard!


01:15:14.401 --> 01:15:15.535
Yeah! Ha ha!


01:15:15.568 --> 01:15:16.769
What?


01:15:21.741 --> 01:15:23.843
Just in time, little brother.


01:15:23.876 --> 01:15:28.148
Oh, you sure know
how to make an entrance.


01:15:29.582 --> 01:15:32.419
Oh... I'll never let you go again!


01:15:35.122 --> 01:15:36.723
How did you ever get here?


01:15:36.756 --> 01:15:39.692
Everybody, these are my friends,


01:15:39.726 --> 01:15:41.628
- Olga and Kiki...
- Ahem.


01:15:41.661 --> 01:15:44.231
And Oleg.


01:15:44.264 --> 01:15:45.731
I wouldn't be here
if it wasn't for them.


01:15:45.732 --> 01:15:48.135
Enchanté!


01:15:48.168 --> 01:15:50.870
It was our pleasure, right, Oleg?


01:15:55.142 --> 01:15:58.177
I owe you an apology, Richard.


01:15:59.912 --> 01:16:02.615
I should have believed in you.


01:16:02.649 --> 01:16:07.086
Sparrow or stork... you are my son.


01:16:13.860 --> 01:16:17.230
I... I can be part of the family?


01:16:17.264 --> 01:16:19.899
Nothing would make me prouder.


01:16:26.273 --> 01:16:27.640
Mmm.


01:16:27.674 --> 01:16:29.509
Aww!


01:16:31.878 --> 01:16:34.681
Next stop, the Great Lake!


01:16:34.714 --> 01:16:36.916
Richard...


01:16:36.949 --> 01:16:39.152
would you lead us?


01:16:39.186 --> 01:16:41.288
Really?! Me?


01:16:41.321 --> 01:16:45.425
When you're ready, give the signal.


01:16:45.458 --> 01:16:47.327
Hey, Richard?


01:16:47.360 --> 01:16:50.297
South is that way!


01:16:56.236 --> 01:16:59.439
Follow me!


01:16:59.472 --> 01:17:01.208
Wait for us!


01:17:01.241 --> 01:17:03.610
We're not all storks, you know!


01:17:03.643 --> 01:17:05.945
Come on, everyone! Keep the pace!


01:17:05.978 --> 01:17:09.316
Jeez, little brother!
Been training?


01:17:12.285 --> 01:17:14.721
Ah...


01:17:24.831 --> 01:17:27.200
Whoa! That must be it!


01:17:27.234 --> 01:17:31.338
Yeah! The Great Lake!


01:17:34.541 --> 01:17:38.478
Ooh! Now that's what I call
a deluxe resort!


01:17:38.511 --> 01:17:41.548
Thanks, Oleg.


01:17:41.581 --> 01:17:43.850
I couldn't have done it without you.


01:17:45.418 --> 01:17:48.488
We did it. We really did it!


01:17:48.521 --> 01:17:51.858
Woo-hoo!


01:17:51.891 --> 01:17:56.763
Come on, guys! Yeah!

